[[1,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the car on a ramp.</p><p>Open the bonnet lid.</p><p>With the ignition key in the OFF position,\ndisconnect the battery negative terminal.</p><p><a href=\"#/2891337\">1088E10</a></p><p>Raise the car.</p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connections (1a), (1b), (1c), (1d)\nand (1e).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Detonation sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890658\">K50</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Brake fluid level sensor (switch)</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890615\">K30</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Timing sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890652\">K47</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1d</p></td><td><p>RPM sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890647\">K46</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1e</p></td><td><p>Alternator</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2889719\">A10</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo nut (2a) and disconnect the earth cable from starter motor\n(2b).</p><p>3. Open the wiring channel and take out the injection system wiring.</p><p>4. Disconnect electrical connections (4a), (4b), (4c), (4d), (4e),\n(4f), (4g), (4h) and (4i).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>4a</p></td><td><p>Injector</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890940\">N70</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>4b</p></td><td><p>Ignition coil</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2889731\">A30</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>4c</p></td><td><p>Engine coolant temperature sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890643\">K45</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>4d</p></td><td><p>Speedometer sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890716\">K84</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>4e</p></td><td><p>Engine management ECU</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890763\">M10A</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>4f</p></td><td><p>Front/engine junction</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890015\">D4</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>4g</p></td><td><p>Throttle position sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890669\">K56</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>4h</p></td><td><p>Idle actuator</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890975\">N74</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>4i</p></td><td><p>Integrated air temperature sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890638\">K43</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>5. Release the wiring from the retaining collars and remove it.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2033962.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,63,0,"<h3 clas