/p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Engine management ECU</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890762\">M10</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Speedometer sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890716\">K84</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Engine coolant temperature sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890643\">K45</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Ignition coil</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2889731\">A30</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Injector</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890940\">N70</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Close the wiring channel after arranging\nthe injection system wiring.</p><p>Connect the earth lead to the starter motor.</p><p>Connect the electrical connections to the\nfront part of the engine.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Detonation sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890658\">K50</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Brake fluid level sensor (switch)</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890615\">K30</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Timing sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890652\">K47</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>RPM sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890647\">K46</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Alternator</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2889719\">A10</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Lower the vehicle.</p><p><a href=\"#/2891337\">1088E10</a></p><p>With the ignition key in stop position,\nconnect the battery negative terminal.</p><p>Close the bonnet lid.</p><p>Remove the vehicle from the ramp.</p>"]]